{"id":"4658e52eae77575f","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-tree11-homogeneous-subtree.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Homogeneous Subtree","display":"df-zfc-tree11-homogeneous-subtree — ZFC Tree11 Homogeneous Subtree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-homogeneous-subtree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-homogeneous-subtree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-homogeneous-subtree — ZFC Tree11 Homogeneous Subtree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-homogeneous-subtree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-homogeneous-subtree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-homogeneous-subtree — ZFC Tree11 Homogeneous Subtree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"336078cd2c28561e\" href=\"?note=336078cd2c28561e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,c,r,t\\in V\">\\(S,T,c,r,t\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S\\)</span>（子树谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"336078cd2c28561e\" href=\"?note=336078cd2c28561e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md\">../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（函数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11HomogeneousSubtree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11HomogeneousSubtree}_S\\)</span>（关于节点着色的齐次子树谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11HomogeneousSubtree}_S(S,T,c)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,T,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\\land\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\;\\forall t\\in S\\;(c(t)=r)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}homogeneous\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11HomogeneousSubtree}_S(S,T,c)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,T,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\\land\\exists r\\in\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\;\\forall t\\in S\\;(c(t)=r)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该谓词采用 Ramsey 论中的含义：着色 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 在子树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上恒定。</li>\n<li>“齐次树”也可指自同构群在每一层上传递；那是另一谓词，不应作为单色子树的定义前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locat